 8080/tcp only), firewalld enabled, sshd active\"},{\"requirement\":\"Functional proof that SSH/8080 work and unrelated ports are rejected\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-fc079fcb771d4003\"],\"summary\":\"Live HTTP listener on 8080 reachable (200 OK) via NODE_IP; connection to unrelated port 9090 failed/refused; nft ruleset shows reject with icmpx admin-prohibited for undefined traffic\"},{\"requirement\":\"Pre-restart baseline for mandatory restart protocol\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-97fa9365973e4c22\"],\"summary\":\"Recorded pre-restart boot_id bf4e9cbb..., firewalld active/enabled, sshd active, public zone rules (ssh, 8080/tcp)\"},{\"requirement\":\"Restart acknowledgement returned before disconnect\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4f765f0b1eea443a\"],\"summary\":\"systemctl reboot issued via backgrounded command; exec stream closed as node went down, confirming reboot took effect\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node unreachable during restart, then command execution restored\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-88ae97bcf1194758\",\"cmd-c57afe4d13c442bd\",\"cmd-fd337058b4e54d3b\"],\"summary\":\"Connection timed out / reset while node was rebooting; subsequent poll succeeded once node came back up\"},{\"requirement\":\"Proof of changed boot identity (real restart, not just service restart)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-fd337058b4e54d3b\"],\"summary\":\"boot_id changed from bf4e9cbb-84f9-45f0-9b81-6602b98cea07 to a6aa9681-22fa-404a-878d-88988b68d547, with new uptime start time\"},{\"requirement\":\"Post-restart recovery of firewall, SSH, and functional behavior\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e3f9672e54a7495d\"],\"summary\":\"Post-restart: firewalld active/enabled, sshd active, permanent and runtime public zone rules intact (ssh, 8080/tcp only), 8080 reachable (200), unrelated port 9090 still rejected\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured firewalld on node1 (RHEL 9) as a persistent host firewall: public zone now permanently allows only SSH (service) and TCP 8080 (port), with cockpit 